#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:5
msgid "The Recomposable Ecosystem Library for Integrated Coupling (RELIC) represents a terrestrial biogeochemical model as a directed composition of typed scientific Functors under shared parameter and state governance (*Methods of Ecological Analysis*, Chapters 1--5, 10, 11, and 14). Each concrete Functor maps declared read-only state and external forcing tensors to typed update records without mutating shared storage in place:"
msgstr "可重组生态系统集成耦合库（Recomposable Ecosystem Library for Integrated Coupling, RELIC）在共享参数与状态治理下，将陆地生物地球化学模型表示为类型化科学 Functor 的有向组合（书稿《生态学分析方法》第 1--5、10、11 及 14 章）。每个具体 Functor 将已声明的只读状态张量与外部强迫张量映射为类型化更新记录，严禁对共享存储执行原地修改："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:12
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathcal{F}_{\\boldsymbol{\\theta}_i}:\n"
"(\\mathbf{S}_t,\\; \\boldsymbol{\\xi}_t,\\; t,\\; \\Delta t)\n"
"\\longmapsto\n"
"\\{\\Delta \\mathbf{S}_i,\\; \\mathbf{q}_i,\\; \\mathbf{d}_i\\},\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\mathcal{F}_{\\boldsymbol{\\theta}_i}:\n"
"(\\mathbf{S}_t,\\; \\boldsymbol{\\xi}_t,\\; t,\\; \\Delta t)\n"
"\\longmapsto\n"
"\\{\\Delta \\mathbf{S}_i,\\; \\mathbf{q}_i,\\; \\mathbf{d}_i\\},\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:19
#, python-brace-format
msgid "where $\\mathbf{S}_t$ is the prognostic state vector, $\\boldsymbol{\\xi}_t$ is external forcing, $\\boldsymbol{\\theta}_i$ is the `ParameterManager`-owned parameter vector, $\\mathbf{q}_i$ denotes flux or tendency outputs, and $\\mathbf{d}_i$ denotes diagnostic observations. `RELICSimulator` (`relic.core.simulator`) governs topological execution and multi-rate scheduling, while `StateManager` (`relic.core.state.manager`) executes unit validation, bounds accounting, elemental conservation ledgers, and atomic commits."
msgstr "其中，$\\mathbf{S}_t$ 为预报状态向量，$\\boldsymbol{\\xi}_t$ 为外部强迫，$\\boldsymbol{\\theta}_i$ 为由 `ParameterManager` 持有的参数向量，$\\mathbf{q}_i$ 表示通量或倾向输出，$\\mathbf{d}_i$ 表示诊断观测量。`RELICSimulator`（`relic.core.simulator`）治理拓扑执行与多速率调度，`StateManager`（`relic.core.state.manager`）执行单位校验、边界核算、元素守恒账本与原子提交。"

