#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:70
msgid "`FunctorMetadata` (`relic.core.functor.functor_base`) declares `input_variables`, `output_variables`, `spatial_scale` (`SpatialScale`), `temporal_scale` (`TemporalScale`), `variable_kind` (`VariableKind`), `execution_phase` (`ExecutionPhase`), and `sub_flow_accuracy` (`SubFlowAccuracy`). Six `VariableKind` enumerators classify tensor I/O (`STATE`, `FORCING`, `PARAMETER`, `FLUX`, `DIAGNOSTIC`, plus the `UNKNOWN` sentinel for undeclared roles):"
