#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:86
msgid "`spatial_scale`, `temporal_scale`, and `variable_kind` apply to the Functor as a whole: `spatial_scale` drives label-level compatibility checks, `variable_kind` drives single-writer overlap checks (`relic.core.simulator.output_overlap_governance`), and `temporal_scale` assigns default `fast`, `medium`, or `slow` execution groups when neither `execution_group` nor `characteristic_time_days` is specified (any explicit `process_groups` entry must match or registration raises `ValueError`)."
msgstr "`spatial_scale`、`temporal_scale` 与 `variable_kind` 作用于整个 Functor：`spatial_scale` 驱动标签级尺度相容性检查，`variable_kind` 驱动单一写入者重叠检查（`relic.core.simulator.output_overlap_governance`），而当未指定 `execution_group` 与 `characteristic_time_days` 时，`temporal_scale` 负责分配默认的 `fast`、`medium` 或 `slow` 执行组（任何显式配置的 `process_groups` 条目均须与之匹配，否则注册时将抛出 `ValueError`）。"

