#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:96
msgid "Scale labels do not define cell geometry, cell areas, or extensivity. Basis-aware spatial operators (`ConservativeRemap`, `ConservativeRegridder`, `SpatialAggregation`, `HierarchicalAggregator`, `ScaleManager`, simulator auto-regridding, and external-forcing adapters) require an explicit `SpatialQuantityBasis` (`relic.coupling.scales.types`) via `spatial_basis` metadata or the `quantity_basis` argument (*Methods of Ecological Analysis*, Chapters 2 and 14):"
msgstr "尺度标签本身并不定义网格单元几何、单元面积或广延性。具备基准感知能力的空间算子（`ConservativeRemap`、`ConservativeRegridder`、`SpatialAggregation`、`HierarchicalAggregator`、`ScaleManager`、模拟器自动重网格化以及外部强迫适配器）必须通过 `spatial_basis` 元数据或 `quantity_basis` 参数显式接收 `SpatialQuantityBasis`（`relic.coupling.scales.types`；书稿《生态学分析方法》第 2 章与第 14 章）："

