#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:111
msgid "Bare `\"extensive\"` is rejected with `ValueError` because it fails to distinguish per-cell totals from areal densities. Exact conversion between `cell_total` and `area_density` (`convert_spatial_basis`) requires strictly positive cell areas $A_i > 0$ ($X_i = x_i A_i$); conversions involving `intensive` or `categorical` raise `ValueError`. Note that `SpatialQuantityBasis` governs spatial support transfer and is distinct from `CochainSpaceSpec.extensivity` in `relic.computation.operators.dec.forms`."
msgstr "单独传入 `\"extensive\"` 因无法区分单元总量与面密度，会被直接拒绝并抛出 `ValueError`。`cell_total` 与 `area_density` 之间的精确换算（`convert_spatial_basis`）要求单元面积严格为正 $A_i > 0$（$X_i = x_i A_i$）；涉及 `intensive` 或 `categorical` 的换算将抛出 `ValueError`。`SpatialQuantityBasis` 治理空间支撑域传递，与 `relic.computation.operators.dec.forms` 中的 `CochainSpaceSpec.extensivity` 分属不同语义。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:119
#, python-brace-format
msgid "For first-order overlap remapping with source-target overlap area $A_{iJ} \\ge 0$, source area $A_i > 0$, target area $A_J > 0$, covered target area $C_J = \\sum_i A_{iJ}$, and covered source fraction $f_i = \\sum_J A_{iJ}/A_i \\le 1$, `ConservativeRemap` and `ConservativeRegridder` evaluate:"
msgstr "对于源-目标重叠面积 $A_{iJ} \\ge 0$、源单元面积 $A_i > 0$、目标单元面积 $A_J > 0$、目标受覆盖面积 $C_J = \\sum_i A_{iJ}$ 以及源单元受覆盖比例 $f_i = \\sum_J A_{iJ}/A_i \\le 1$ 的一阶重叠守恒重映射，`ConservativeRemap` 与 `ConservativeRegridder` 按下式求值："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:125
msgid ""
"\n"
"Y_J = \\sum_i X_i\\,\\frac{A_{iJ}}{A_i} \\quad (\\texttt{cell\\_total}),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"y_J = \\frac{1}{A_J}\\sum_i x_i A_{iJ} \\quad (\\texttt{area\\_density}),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"y_J = \\frac{1}{C_J}\\sum_i x_i A_{iJ} \\quad (\\texttt{intensive}).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Y_J = \\sum_i X_i\\,\\frac{A_{iJ}}{A_i} \\quad (\\texttt{cell\\_total}),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"y_J = \\frac{1}{A_J}\\sum_i x_i A_{iJ} \\quad (\\texttt{area\\_density}),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"y_J = \\frac{1}{C_J}\\sum_i x_i A_{iJ} \\quad (\\texttt{intensive}).\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:133
msgid "Amounts are conserved strictly over covered support:"
msgstr "总量在受覆盖支撑域上严格守恒："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:135
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\sum_J Y_J = \\sum_i f_i X_i,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"U = \\sum_i (1 - f_i)\\,X_i,\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\sum_J Y_J = \\sum_i f_i X_i,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"U = \\sum_i (1 - f_i)\\,X_i,\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:141
msgid "where uncovered source mass $U$ is reported in diagnostics and never rescaled onto covered target cells. Explicit cell bounds, overlap matrices, or polygon vertices are mandatory; bounds are never inferred from coordinate spacing. External-model ingestion reads Climate and Forecast (CF) bounds for 1D rectilinear coordinates and rejects 2D curvilinear grids lacking explicit cell corners during conservative remapping (`SpatialScaling.regrid` with `method=\"conservative\"` on a coordinate-free grid descriptor switches to non-conservative nearest-neighbour lookup)."
msgstr "其中，未受覆盖的源质量 $U$ 在诊断量中显式报告，绝不重缩放到已受覆盖的目标单元上。单元边界、重叠矩阵或多边形顶点必须显式提供，绝不根据坐标间距推断边界。外部模型数据接入针对一维正交直线坐标读取气候与预报（Climate and Forecast, CF）边界元数据，并在守恒重映射期间拒绝缺少显式单元角点的二维曲线网格（在无坐标网格描述符上以 `method=\"conservative\"` 调用 `SpatialScaling.regrid` 时，将切换为非守恒的最近邻查找）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:150
#, python-brace-format
msgid "In time, `TemporalAggregator` and `TemporalDisaggregator` (`relic.coupling.scales.temporal`) require explicit `temporal_semantics` (`interval_mean`, `rate`, `interval_accumulation`, or `state_at_boundary`; `point_sample` and `categorical` are rejected) together with explicit source and target units. Over target interval $j$ of duration $\\tau_j$ with source-target overlap durations $O_{ij}$ and validity mask $m_i \\in \\{0, 1\\}$, `interval_mean` and rate-to-rate mappings evaluate:"
msgstr "在时间维度上，`TemporalAggregator` 与 `TemporalDisaggregator`（`relic.coupling.scales.temporal`）要求显式声明 `temporal_semantics`（`interval_mean`、`rate`、`interval_accumulation` 或 `state_at_boundary`；`point_sample` 与 `categorical` 会被拒绝）以及显式的源单位和目标单位。在持续时间为 $\\tau_j$ 的目标区间 $j$ 上，给定源-目标重叠时长 $O_{ij}$ 与有效性掩码 $m_i \\in \\{0, 1\\}$，`interval_mean` 及速率到速率映射按下式求值："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:158
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\bar{x}_j = \\frac{\\sum_i m_i O_{ij}\\,x_i}{\\sum_i m_i O_{ij}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"c_j = \\frac{1}{\\tau_j}\\sum_i m_i O_{ij},\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\bar{x}_j = \\frac{\\sum_i m_i O_{ij}\\,x_i}{\\sum_i m_i O_{ij}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"c_j = \\frac{1}{\\tau_j}\\sum_i m_i O_{ij},\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:164
#, python-brace-format
msgid "returning $\\bar{x}_j$ when dimensionless coverage $c_j$ meets `coupling.scales.temporal.coverage_threshold` and `NaN` below threshold without extrapolating missing intervals. `TemporalScaling` maps fixed SI durations via `method` (`mean`, `rate`, `sum`, `total`, `extensive`, or law names) and rejects calendar-dependent `month` or `year` intervals."
msgstr "当无量纲覆盖度 $c_j$ 达到 `coupling.scales.temporal.coverage_threshold` 时返回 $\\bar{x}_j$，低于阈值时返回 `NaN`，绝不对缺失区间执行外推。`TemporalScaling` 通过 `method`（`mean`、`rate`、`sum`、`total`、`extensive` 或守恒律名称）映射固定国际单位制时长，并拒绝依赖日历长度的 `month` 或 `year` 区间。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:170
msgid "Universal conservation and balance laws"
msgstr "普适守恒与平衡定律"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:172
msgid "Local, stoichiometric, and control-volume balances"
msgstr "局地、化学计量与控制体平衡"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:174
msgid "For a conserved scalar density $c(\\mathbf{x}, t)$ with velocity $\\mathbf{v}$, diffusivity $D$, internal stoichiometric network $N r(c, \\boldsymbol{\\theta}, \\boldsymbol{\\xi})$, and open-boundary exchange $s_{\\mathrm{bnd}}$, the continuum and integral control-volume balances on domain $\\Omega$ with outward normal $\\mathbf{n}$ are (*Methods of Ecological Analysis*, Chapters 3--5):"
msgstr "对于具有流速 $\\mathbf{v}$、扩散系数 $D$、内部化学计量网络 $N r(c, \\boldsymbol{\\theta}, \\boldsymbol{\\xi})$ 及开放边界交换项 $s_{\\mathrm{bnd}}$ 的守恒标量密度 $c(\\mathbf{x}, t)$，其在外法向为 $\\mathbf{n}$ 的区域 $\\Omega$ 上的连续介质微分形式与控制体积分平衡方程为（书稿《生态学分析方法》第 3--5 章）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:180
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\partial c}{\\partial t} + \\nabla \\cdot \\left(\\mathbf{v}c - D\\nabla c\\right)\n"
"= N r + s_{\\mathrm{bnd}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\int_{\\Omega} c\\,\\mathrm{d}V\n"
"= -\\int_{\\partial\\Omega} \\mathbf{F}\\cdot\\mathbf{n}\\,\\mathrm{d}A\n"
"+ \\int_{\\Omega} N r\\,\\mathrm{d}V\n"
"+ \\int_{\\Omega} s_{\\mathrm{bnd}}\\,\\mathrm{d}V.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\partial c}{\\partial t} + \\nabla \\cdot \\left(\\mathbf{v}c - D\\nabla c\\right)\n"
"= N r + s_{\\mathrm{bnd}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\int_{\\Omega} c\\,\\mathrm{d}V\n"
"= -\\int_{\\partial\\Omega} \\mathbf{F}\\cdot\\mathbf{n}\\,\\mathrm{d}A\n"
"+ \\int_{\\Omega} N r\\,\\mathrm{d}V\n"
"+ \\int_{\\Omega} s_{\\mathrm{bnd}}\\,\\mathrm{d}V.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:190
msgid "After spatial discretization into prognostic reservoir vector $\\mathbf{S}(t) \\in \\mathbb{R}^n$ with internal process stoichiometries $\\{\\mathbf{N}_p\\}_{p \\in \\mathcal{P}_{\\mathrm{int}}}$ and boundary port operators $\\{\\mathbf{B}_q\\}_{q \\in \\mathcal{P}_{\\mathrm{ext}}}$, the semi-discrete coupled evolution is:"
msgstr "空间离散化为预报储库向量 $\\mathbf{S}(t) \\in \\mathbb{R}^n$ 后，结合内部过程化学计量矩阵族 $\\{\\mathbf{N}_p\\}_{p \\in \\mathcal{P}_{\\mathrm{int}}}$ 与边界端口算子族 $\\{\\mathbf{B}_q\\}_{q \\in \\mathcal{P}_{\\mathrm{ext}}}$，半离散耦合演化方程写为："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:196
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}\\mathbf{S}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\n"
"= \\sum_{p \\in \\mathcal{P}_{\\mathrm{int}}}\n"
"\\mathbf{N}_p\\,\\mathbf{J}_p(\\mathbf{S}, \\boldsymbol{\\xi}, \\boldsymbol{\\theta}, t)\n"
"+ \\sum_{q \\in \\mathcal{P}_{\\mathrm{ext}}}\n"
"\\mathbf{B}_q\\,\\mathbf{u}_q(\\mathbf{S}, \\boldsymbol{\\xi}, \\boldsymbol{\\theta}, t).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}\\mathbf{S}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\n"
"= \\sum_{p \\in \\mathcal{P}_{\\mathrm{int}}}\n"
"\\mathbf{N}_p\\,\\mathbf{J}_p(\\mathbf{S}, \\boldsymbol{\\xi}, \\boldsymbol{\\theta}, t)\n"
"+ \\sum_{q \\in \\mathcal{P}_{\\mathrm{ext}}}\n"
"\\mathbf{B}_q\\,\\mathbf{u}_q(\\mathbf{S}, \\boldsymbol{\\xi}, \\boldsymbol{\\theta}, t).\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:204
msgid "For any conserved elemental ledger matrix $C$ (rows encoding water, carbon, nitrogen, phosphorus, or charge content per state unit), internal closure requires the stoichiometric nullspace condition:"
msgstr "对于任意守恒元素账本矩阵 $C$（各行编码每单位状态量所含的水、碳、氮、磷或电荷量），内部守恒闭合要求满足化学计量零空间条件："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:208
msgid ""
"\n"
"C \\mathbf{N}_p = 0 \\quad \\forall p \\in \\mathcal{P}_{\\mathrm{int}}\n"
"\\qquad \\Longrightarrow \\qquad\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}(C\\mathbf{S})\n"
"= \\sum_{q \\in \\mathcal{P}_{\\mathrm{ext}}} C\\mathbf{B}_q\\,\\mathbf{u}_q.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"C \\mathbf{N}_p = 0 \\quad \\forall p \\in \\mathcal{P}_{\\mathrm{int}}\n"
"\\qquad \\Longrightarrow \\qquad\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}(C\\mathbf{S})\n"
"= \\sum_{q \\in \\mathcal{P}_{\\mathrm{ext}}} C\\mathbf{B}_q\\,\\mathbf{u}_q.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:215
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Non-zero changes in $C\\mathbf{S}$ must traverse an explicit port, boundary export, managed export, diagnostic residual, or observation route."
msgstr "$C\\mathbf{S}$ 的任何非零变化均必须经由显式声明的端口、边界输出、人为管理输出、诊断残差或观测路由传递。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:218
msgid "Energy and entropy balances"
msgstr "能量与熵平衡"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:220
msgid "When a process declares thermodynamic energy $E(\\mathbf{S})$, entropy $S(\\mathbf{S})$, and conjugate port effort-flow pairs $(e_{\\mathrm{port}}, f_{\\mathrm{port}})$ with port power $P_{\\mathrm{port}} = e_{\\mathrm{port}}^{\\mathsf{T}} f_{\\mathrm{port}}$, the first- and second-law balances take the form:"
msgstr "当过程声明热力学能量 $E(\\mathbf{S})$、熵 $S(\\mathbf{S})$ 以及端口功率为 $P_{\\mathrm{port}} = e_{\\mathrm{port}}^{\\mathsf{T}} f_{\\mathrm{port}}$ 的共轭端口势-流对 $(e_{\\mathrm{port}}, f_{\\mathrm{port}})$ 时，热力学第一定律与第二定律平衡方程具有如下形式："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:225
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}E}{\\mathrm{d}t} = P_{\\mathrm{in}} - P_{\\mathrm{out}} - D_E,\n"
"\\quad D_E \\ge 0,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}S}{\\mathrm{d}t} = \\Phi_S + \\sigma,\n"
"\\quad \\sigma \\ge 0,\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}E}{\\mathrm{d}t} = P_{\\mathrm{in}} - P_{\\mathrm{out}} - D_E,\n"
"\\quad D_E \\ge 0,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}S}{\\mathrm{d}t} = \\Phi_S + \\sigma,\n"
"\\quad \\sigma \\ge 0,\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:233
msgid "where $D_E$ is internal mechanical/thermal dissipation, $\\Phi_S$ is boundary entropy flux, and $\\sigma$ is internal entropy production. Empirical rate laws without declared potentials and operators are audited through mass/energy budget ledgers at certificate Levels 1--3 without fabricating synthetic thermodynamic potentials."
msgstr "其中，$D_E$ 为内部机械/热耗散，$\\Phi_S$ 为边界熵通量，$\\sigma$ 为内部熵产生率。未声明热力学势与结构算子的经验速率律在证书等级 1--3 下通过质量/能量收支账本审计，绝不凭空构造人工热力学势。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:239
msgid "Transactional StateManager governance (`I1`--`I7`)"
msgstr "事务型 StateManager 状态治理（`I1`--`I7`）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:241
msgid "`partition_outputs` (`relic.core.state.types`) splits every Functor return mapping into state updates (`UpdateItem`), diagnostics, and immutable `ExternalIntent` records according to `UpdateMode` (`ACCUMULATE`, `REPLACE`, `FLUX`) and `StateWriteMode` (`MUTABLE`, `IMMUTABLE`, `DERIVED`):"
msgstr "`partition_outputs`（`relic.core.state.types`）依据 `UpdateMode`（`ACCUMULATE`、`REPLACE`、`FLUX`）与 `StateWriteMode`（`MUTABLE`、`IMMUTABLE`、`DERIVED`），将每个 Functor 的返回映射拆分为状态更新项（`UpdateItem`）、诊断量与不可变的 `ExternalIntent` 记录："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:246
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf{S}_{n+1} = \\mathbf{S}_n + \\Delta t\\,\\mathbf{q}\n"
"\\quad (\\texttt{ACCUMULATE}/\\texttt{FLUX},\\; \\texttt{per\\_timestep=False}),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathbf{S}_{n+1} = \\mathbf{S}_n + \\Delta\\mathbf{S}\n"
"\\quad (\\texttt{ACCUMULATE},\\; \\texttt{per\\_timestep=True}),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathbf{S}_{n+1} = \\mathbf{S}_{\\mathrm{new}}\n"
"\\quad (\\texttt{REPLACE}).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf{S}_{n+1} = \\mathbf{S}_n + \\Delta t\\,\\mathbf{q}\n"
"\\quad (\\texttt{ACCUMULATE}/\\texttt{FLUX},\\; \\texttt{per\\_timestep=False}),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathbf{S}_{n+1} = \\mathbf{S}_n + \\Delta\\mathbf{S}\n"
"\\quad (\\texttt{ACCUMULATE},\\; \\texttt{per\\_timestep=True}),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\mathbf{S}_{n+1} = \\mathbf{S}_{\\mathrm{new}}\n"
"\\quad (\\texttt{REPLACE}).\n"

