#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:284
msgid "Centralized ParameterManager and physical-constant SSOT"
msgstr "集中式 ParameterManager 与物理常数单点事实源"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:286
msgid "`ParameterManager` (`relic.parameters.manager`) owns all model coefficients, bounds, units, dtypes, references, and gradient flags. In the live database under `relic/parameters/database/`, `138` YAML files (`134` under `relic/` and `4` under `calibrated/`) define `4,751` leaf entries (`4,642` core + `109` calibrated overrides), resolving to `4,643` active default runtime parameters of which `810` carry `with_gradients: true` for differentiable calibration. Inside a Functor, parameters are retrieved exclusively via `self.get_parameter_value(name, required=...)`."
msgstr "`ParameterManager`（`relic.parameters.manager`）统一持有全部模型系数、取值边界、单位、数据类型、文献引用及梯度标志。在 `relic/parameters/database/` 下的现行参数库中，`138` 个 YAML 文件（`relic/` 下 `134` 个，`calibrated/` 下 `4` 个）共定义 `4,751` 个叶节点条目（`4,642` 个核心条目加 `109` 个率定覆盖条目），解析为 `4,643` 个活动默认运行时参数，其中 `810` 个标记 `with_gradients: true` 以支持可微率定。在 Functor 内部，参数仅通过 `self.get_parameter_value(name, required=...)` 检索获取。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:295
msgid "Universal and material physical constants (CODATA gas constant $R$, Stefan-Boltzmann constant $\\sigma$, Avogadro constant $N_A$, standard gravity $g$, von Karman constant $\\kappa$, molar masses, and phase-change enthalpies) reside solely in `relic/parameters/database/relic/physical/constants.yaml` as a Single Source of Truth (SSOT) and are accessed via `get_physical_constant` (`relic.utils.physical_constants`). Domain YAML files and Python modules never redefine physical constants. Dimensional conversions preserve exact stoichiometry; converting molar assimilation $A$ [$\\mu$mol CO$_2$ m$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$] to carbon mass flux $F_{\\mathrm{C}}$ [kg C m$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$] applies $F_{\\mathrm{C}} = A\\,M_{\\mathrm{C}}\\,10^{-9}$ using SSOT carbon molar mass $M_{\\mathrm{C}}$ [g mol$^{-1}$]."
msgstr "普适物理常数与物质常数（CODATA 气体常数 $R$、斯特藩-玻尔兹曼常数 $\\sigma$、阿伏伽德罗常数 $N_A$、标准重力加速度 $g$、冯·卡门常数 $\\kappa$、摩尔质量及相变焓）作为单点事实源（Single Source of Truth, SSOT）唯一存储于 `relic/parameters/database/relic/physical/constants.yaml` 中，并通过 `get_physical_constant`（`relic.utils.physical_constants`）访问。各领域 YAML 文件与 Python 模块绝不重复定义物理常数。量纲换算严格保持化学计量关系：将摩尔同化速率 $A$ [$\\mu$mol CO$_2$ m$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$] 换算为碳质量通量 $F_{\\mathrm{C}}$ [kg C m$^{-2}$ s$^{-1}$] 时，统一采用 SSOT 碳摩尔质量 $M_{\\mathrm{C}}$ [g mol$^{-1}$] 执行 $F_{\\mathrm{C}} = A\\,M_{\\mathrm{C}}\\,10^{-9}$。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:307
msgid "Piecewise-smooth discrete adjoint differentiation and device policy"
msgstr "分段光滑离散伴随微分与设备策略"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:309
msgid "Because `FunctorBase` subclasses `torch.nn.Module`, macro-step transitions $\\mathbf{S}_t = \\Phi_t(\\mathbf{S}_{t-1}, \\boldsymbol{\\theta})$ ($t = 1, \\dots, N_t$) from initial state $\\mathbf{S}_0(\\boldsymbol{\\theta})$ construct an exact reverse-mode discrete adjoint graph in `torch.autograd` (*Methods of Ecological Analysis*, Chapter 10). Because $\\boldsymbol{\\theta}$ enters every step transition $\\Phi_t$ directly, the total terminal objective gradient $\\frac{\\mathrm{d}\\mathcal{L}(\\mathbf{S}_{N_t}, \\boldsymbol{\\theta})}{\\mathrm{d}\\boldsymbol{\\theta}}$ accumulates step-wise parameter Jacobians across the full trajectory:"
msgstr "由于 `FunctorBase` 继承自 `torch.nn.Module`，从初始状态 $\\mathbf{S}_0(\\boldsymbol{\\theta})$ 出发的宏步状态转移 $\\mathbf{S}_t = \\Phi_t(\\mathbf{S}_{t-1}, \\boldsymbol{\\theta})$（$t = 1, \\dots, N_t$）在 `torch.autograd` 中构建起精确的反向模式离散伴随计算图（书稿《生态学分析方法》第 10 章）。由于 $\\boldsymbol{\\theta}$ 直接参与每一步转移映射 $\\Phi_t$，终端目标函数的全梯度 $\\frac{\\mathrm{d}\\mathcal{L}(\\mathbf{S}_{N_t}, \\boldsymbol{\\theta})}{\\mathrm{d}\\boldsymbol{\\theta}}$ 沿完整轨迹累加各步参数雅可比项："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:318
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}\\mathcal{L}}{\\mathrm{d}\\boldsymbol{\\theta}}\n"
"= \\frac{\\partial \\mathcal{L}}{\\partial \\boldsymbol{\\theta}}\n"
"+ \\frac{\\partial \\mathcal{L}}{\\partial \\mathbf{S}_{N_t}}\n"
"\\left(\\prod_{k=1}^{N_t} \\frac{\\partial \\Phi_k}{\\partial \\mathbf{S}_{k-1}}\\right)\n"
"\\frac{\\partial \\mathbf{S}_0}{\\partial \\boldsymbol{\\theta}}\n"
"+ \\sum_{t=1}^{N_t}\n"
"\\frac{\\partial \\mathcal{L}}{\\partial \\mathbf{S}_{N_t}}\n"
"\\left(\\prod_{k=t+1}^{N_t} \\frac{\\partial \\Phi_k}{\\partial \\mathbf{S}_{k-1}}\\right)\n"
"\\frac{\\partial \\Phi_t}{\\partial \\boldsymbol{\\theta}},\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\frac{\\mathrm{d}\\mathcal{L}}{\\mathrm{d}\\boldsymbol{\\theta}}\n"
"= \\frac{\\partial \\mathcal{L}}{\\partial \\boldsymbol{\\theta}}\n"
"+ \\frac{\\partial \\mathcal{L}}{\\partial \\mathbf{S}_{N_t}}\n"
"\\left(\\prod_{k=1}^{N_t} \\frac{\\partial \\Phi_k}{\\partial \\mathbf{S}_{k-1}}\\right)\n"
"\\frac{\\partial \\mathbf{S}_0}{\\partial \\boldsymbol{\\theta}}\n"
"+ \\sum_{t=1}^{N_t}\n"
"\\frac{\\partial \\mathcal{L}}{\\partial \\mathbf{S}_{N_t}}\n"
"\\left(\\prod_{k=t+1}^{N_t} \\frac{\\partial \\Phi_k}{\\partial \\mathbf{S}_{k-1}}\\right)\n"
"\\frac{\\partial \\Phi_t}{\\partial \\boldsymbol{\\theta}},\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:330
#, python-brace-format
msgid "where matrix products are ordered from left ($k = N_t$) to right ($k = 1$ or $k = t + 1$) and the empty product at $t = N_t$ equals the identity matrix $\\mathbf{I}_n$. Smooth PyTorch tensor paths, linear overlap remaps without post-clipping, and implicit scalar roots solved via `BracketedBisectionSolver` (using implicit-function differentiation) propagate exact discrete sensitivities. Transversal guard crossings require explicit saltation-matrix factors (`relic.computation.solvers.hybrid_events`; see [Numerical Integration, Splitting, Stability, and Stochastic Processes](numerics.md)), whereas hard bounds clipping, discrete regime switches, adaptive step-size rejections, and NumPy-based external ingestion regridding act as non-differentiable boundaries."
msgstr "其中，矩阵连乘按从左（$k = N_t$）到右（$k = 1$ 或 $k = t + 1$）的顺序排列，$t = N_t$ 处的空乘积等于单位矩阵 $\\mathbf{I}_n$。光滑 PyTorch 张量路径、无后置截断的线性重叠重映射，以及经由 `BracketedBisectionSolver`（采用隐函数定理求导）求解的隐式标量根均能传播精确的离散灵敏度。横截守卫面穿越需要显式引入跃变矩阵（saltation matrix）因子（`relic.computation.solvers.hybrid_events`；参见[数值积分、算子分裂、稳定性与随机过程](numerics.md)），而硬边界截断、离散模态切换、自适应步长拒绝以及基于 NumPy 的外部数据接入重网格化则构成不可微边界。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:340
msgid "Device placement is governed centrally by `relic.core.device_policy` (`device`, `require_gpu`, `device_overrides`, `module_device_overrides`). `FunctorBase.__init__` allocates CPU placeholders, and simulator registration migrates modules to the resolved target device (GPU-first with automatic CPU fallback unless `require_gpu: true` or an unsatisfied `enable_distributed: true` contract raises). Scientific modules never invoke `torch.cuda.is_available()` directly."
msgstr "设备放置策略由 `relic.core.device_policy`（`device`、`require_gpu`、`device_overrides`、`module_device_overrides`）集中治理。`FunctorBase.__init__` 仅分配 CPU 占位张量，模拟器注册阶段将各模块迁移至解析后的目标设备（默认 GPU 优先并在无 CUDA 时回退至 CPU；若设置了 `require_gpu: true` 或 `enable_distributed: true` 契约未获满足则直接抛出异常）。科学模块绝不直接调用 `torch.cuda.is_available()`。"

