msgstr "有界数学契约与运行时边界（`[I]` 与 `[N]`）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:349
msgid "Three decidable finite-dimensional operator contracts in `relic.computation.operators` provide numerical verification against `validation/iphs.yaml` tolerances (*Methods of Ecological Analysis*, Chapters 1--3 and 10):"
msgstr "`relic.computation.operators` 中的三项可判定有限维算子契约对照 `validation/iphs.yaml` 容差提供数值验证（书稿《生态学分析方法》第 1--3 章与第 10 章）："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:354
msgid "**Typed linear chain maps (`[I]`)**: `LinearChainMap` (`relic.computation.operators.dec.chain_map`) maps declared 10-field `CochainSpaceSpec` spaces, verifies unit-scaled ledger preservation $\\lVert C_t(u M) - C_s \\rVert_\\infty \\le \\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{cm}}$, and bounds perturbation growth by $\\lVert u M \\rVert_2 \\lVert \\delta x \\rVert_2$. Exact `equals` is an equivalence relation; `close_within` ($\\lVert u_1 M_1 - u_2 M_2 \\rVert_2 \\le \\varepsilon$) is reflexive and symmetric without transitivity. Production consumer: `LitterfallInterfaceMapper`."
msgstr "**类型化线性链映射（`[I]`）**：`LinearChainMap`（`relic.computation.operators.dec.chain_map`）在已声明的十字段 `CochainSpaceSpec` 上链空间之间建立映射，校验经单位缩放的守恒账本保持条件 $\\lVert C_t(u M) - C_s \\rVert_\\infty \\le \\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{cm}}$，并以 $\\lVert u M \\rVert_2 \\lVert \\delta x \\rVert_2$ 界定扰动增长上界。精确相等 `equals` 构成等价关系；容差邻近 `close_within`（$\\lVert u_1 M_1 - u_2 M_2 \\rVert_2 \\le \\varepsilon$）满足自反性与对称性，不具传递性。生产环境调用方：`LitterfallInterfaceMapper`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:363
msgid "**Metzler resource-activity invasion threshold (`[I]`)**: `activity_threshold` and `is_nonsingular_m_matrix` (`relic.computation.operators.invasion_threshold`) verify non-negative growth $G \\ge 0$ and nonsingular M-matrix loss $\\Delta$ ($Z$-matrix sign structure and $\\Delta^{-1} \\ge 0$), evaluate the next-generation spectral radius $\\mathcal{R}_{\\mathrm{act}} = \\rho(\\Delta^{-1} G)$, and cross-check $\\operatorname{sign}(\\mathcal{R}_{\\mathrm{act}} - 1) = \\operatorname{sign}(s(G - \\Delta))$. Values inside $\\lvert \\mathcal{R}_{\\mathrm{act}} - 1 \\rvert \\le \\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{crit}}$ return `verdict=\"critical\"` and `hyperbolic=False` without claiming global bifurcation or persistence. Production consumer: linearized activity-free `MicrobialEnzymeDecomposition`."
msgstr "**Metzler 资源-活性入侵阈值（`[I]`）**：`activity_threshold` 与 `is_nonsingular_m_matrix`（`relic.computation.operators.invasion_threshold`）校验非负增长矩阵 $G \\ge 0$ 与非奇异 M-矩阵损失项 $\\Delta$（满足 $Z$-矩阵符号结构且 $\\Delta^{-1} \\ge 0$），计算下一代算子谱半径 $\\mathcal{R}_{\\mathrm{act}} = \\rho(\\Delta^{-1} G)$，并交叉核验 $\\operatorname{sign}(\\mathcal{R}_{\\mathrm{act}} - 1) = \\operatorname{sign}(s(G - \\Delta))$。落入临界带 $\\lvert \\mathcal{R}_{\\mathrm{act}} - 1 \\rvert \\le \\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{crit}}$ 的取值返回 `verdict=\"critical\"` 与 `hyperbolic=False`，不作全局分岔或持久性推断。生产环境调用方：无活性平衡点处线性化的 `MicrobialEnzymeDecomposition`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/theory/foundations.md:374
msgid "**Affine-leaf relative storage and passivity ledger (`[I]`)**: `relative_storage`, `certify_relative_storage`, and `feedback_power_ledger` (`relic.computation.operators.relative_storage`) retain the full Bregman first-order term $V(x) = F(x) - F(x^\\ast) - \\nabla F(x^\\ast)^{\\mathsf{T}}(x - x^\\ast)$, verify constrained stationarity $\\nabla F(x^\\ast) \\in \\operatorname{im}(C^{\\mathsf{T}})$ and projected Hessian positivity $Z^{\\mathsf{T}}\\nabla^2 F(x^\\ast) Z \\succ 0$ on an SVD basis $Z$ of $\\ker C$ in `float64`, and audit open-system Willems power balance $\\dot{F} = y_F^{\\mathsf{T}} u - \\mathcal{D} + \\Phi_F$. Curved nonlinear conservation manifolds lie outside this contract. Production consumer: closed 1D `FickianDiffusion`."
msgstr "**仿射守恒叶相对存储泛函与无源性账本（`[I]`）**：`relative_storage`、`certify_relative_storage` 与 `feedback_power_ledger`（`relic.computation.operators.relative_storage`）保留完整的 Bregman 一阶项 $V(x) = F(x) - F(x^\\ast) - \\nabla F(x^\\ast)^{\\mathsf{T}}(x - x^\\ast)$，在 `float64` 精度下基于 $\\ker C$ 的奇异值分解（SVD）基 $Z$ 校验约束驻点条件 $\\nabla F(x^\\ast) \\in \\operatorname{im}(C^{\\mathsf{T}})$ 与投影海森矩阵正定性 $Z^{\\mathsf{T}}\\nabla^2 F(x^\\ast) Z \\succ 0$，并审计开放系统 Willems 功率平衡 $\\dot{F} = y_F^{\\mathsf{T}} u - \\mathcal{D} + \\Phi_F$。弯曲非线性守恒流形不在本契约覆盖范围内。生产环境调用方：封闭一维 `FickianDiffusion`。"

